# Commit compressed raw records, manifests and review entry points. Keep expanded
# originals locally for inspection; do not replace or rewrite historical records.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!analysis.json
!historical-evidence.zip
!historical-manifest.json
!runtime-evidence.zip
!runtime-manifest.json
!archive-integrity.json
!delivery-provenance.json
